            <ArticleTitle>[Tinnitus as a side effect of hyposensitization treatment. Case report].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>39-41</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>One patient showed tinnitus during hyposensitization 5 min after injection, resolving without any therapeutical approach within the next 30 min. Moderate increase of dosage did not lead to new symptoms. The question of allergy in the pathomechanism of diseases of the inner ear is discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
